---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contact" class="mt-20 pt-16 border-t border-slate-800/80 reveal">
  <!-- Bagian Ajakan Kerja Sama & Kontak -->
  <div class="mb-14">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">
      Mari Terhubung
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Tertarik untuk berkolaborasi dalam proyek? Jangan ragu untuk menghubungi saya melalui kontak di bawah ini untuk diskusi kerja sama maupun pertanyaan lebih lanjut.
    </p>

    <!-- Grid Kartu Kontak (WhatsApp, Gmail, Lokasi) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      
      <!-- WhatsApp -->
      <a 
        href="https://wa.me/6282397725894" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="p-5 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-all group flex items-start gap-4"
      >
        <div class="p-3 bg-teal-950/80 text-teal-400 rounded-lg border border-teal-800/50 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1">WhatsApp</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">
            +62 823-9772-5894
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Gmail -->
      <a 
        href="mailto:kamilmahsyarakbar@gmail.com"
        class="p-5 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-all group flex items-start gap-4"
      >
        <div class="p-3 bg-teal-950/80 text-teal-400 rounded-lg border border-teal-800/50 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
            <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <span class="block text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1">Gmail</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors truncate block">
            kamilmahsyarakbar@gmail.com
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Lokasi -->
      <div class="p-5 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="p-3 bg-teal-950/80 text-teal-400 rounded-lg border border-teal-800/50">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1">Lokasi</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-200">
            Rappocini Raya LR.9G, Makassar, Indonesia
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Copyright & Tautan Sosial -->
  <div class="border-t border-slate-800/80 py-8 text-slate-400 text-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
